[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CharacterSpec" load_steps=2 format=3]

; The scrapper by the road to town, and the demo's one companion. Moss cloth and copper hair:
; the warden wears rust and the wanderer wears rust, so a third rust coat by the same gate
; would read as one person standing in two places - the hermit's own lesson, applied before
; anybody noticed rather than after.
;
; Short hair and a tunic, because a robe is what the two people who live indoors wear.

